  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to UNICEF  to maintain humanitarian assistance and improve safety for Rohingya refugees in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is Bilateral ODA and an earmarked spend through multilaterals. This is ODA eligible as the programme is providing essential water sanitation and hygiene, education, child protection and health support to Refugees in Bangladesh which is within the DAC List of ODA recipient countries. The support is provided through UNICEF which is within the DAC list of ODA eligible organization.</narrative>
  </description>
